  "id": "visual-yellow",
  "term": "visual yellow",
  "definition": "Visual yellow is the yellow stage seen in the human retina during the light-bleaching of visual purple. It refers to an intermediate product in the sequence of colour changes as the retinal pigment loses its purplish-red colour under illumination.",
